security-concerns-claims-bombshell-report-candace-owens-says-my-jaw-is-on-the-floor/articleshow/134491553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T00:33:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134491568,imgsize-2461605.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[End employment-based Green Card, prioritize English proficiency: Republican Senator brings new America First bill]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134491320.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/end-employment-based-green-card-prioritize-english-proficiency-republican-senator-brings-new-america-first-bill/articleshow/134491320.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/end-employment-based-green-card-prioritize-english-proficiency-republican-senator-brings-new-america-first-bill/articleshow/134491320.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T00:13:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134491334,imgsize-1156333.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Minnesota family farm was sold after receiving approval to be turned into a 262-home community]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134490381.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Heavy machinery has begun grading the former Vierling family farm in Minnesota for a new housing development. The Prior Lake City Council recently approved the plans for the 262-home neighborhood named Vierling Ridge. Pulte Homes aims to complete the main infrastructure by autumn, allowing construction to begin in winter. Various housing styles are planned, catering to different demographics and needs. The entire project is expected to be completed by 2032.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-minnesota-family-farm-has-been-sold-to-a-homebuilder-and-grading-has-already-begun-the-city-has-now-given-final-approval-to-turn-the-88-acre-property-into-a-262-home-community-by-2032/articleshow/134490381.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-minnesota-family-farm-has-been-sold-to-a-homebuilder-and-grading-has-already-begun-the-city-has-now-given-final-approval-to-turn-the-88-acre-property-into-a-262-home-community-by-2032/articleshow/134490381.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-25T23:46:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134490923,imgsize-1492805.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump-Xi bonhomie set to continue, leaders announce two more meetings]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134490297.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping have agreed to meet in November and December. They will hold talks in China and at the G20 summit in Miami. These meetings aim to strengthen the relationship between the two largest economies. However, their recent discussions did not result in significant breakthroughs on various issues. Xi's visit included a state dinner and cultural exchanges during China's Mid-Autumn Festival.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-xi-bonhomie-set-to-continue-leaders-announce-two-more-meetings/articleshow/134490297.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-xi-bonhomie-set-to-continue-leaders-announce-two-more-meetings/articleshow/134490297.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-25T23:10:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134490402,imgsize-79164.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[At age 6, Grace opened a lemonade stand hoping to raise $10, seven summers later, she made $55,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134489553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Grace Hendrian and her sister June initiated their Lemon-Aid Stand for Good in 2019 to support charity. They aimed to raise $10 but ultimately collected $55,000 for The Salvation Army. Their project encouraged community participation, leading to 14 stands operating by 2026. The sisters received recognition for their volunteer efforts as they also contributed to local families in need. Their fundraising initiative concluded in 2026, marking its final season.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-age-6-grace-hendrian-opened-a-lemonade-stand-hoping-to-raise-10-for-the-salvation-army-seven-summers-later-she-and-sister-june-closed-the-project-after-turning-that-tiny-goal-into-about-55000/articleshow/134489553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-age-6-grace-hendrian-opened-a-lemonade-stand-hoping-to-raise-10-for-the-salvation-army-seven-summers-later-she-and-sister-june-closed-the-project-after-turning-that-tiny-goal-into-about-55000/articleshow/134489553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-25T23:05:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134490336,imgsize-1088465.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Pure shock': Attorney Mariah Medina breaks silence as Internet debates over her sleeveless dress criticized by a Texas judge]]></title><description>&lt;im